  "item": [
    {
      "id": "15c79257-c801-4af3-a0a0-d48317be8ed8",
      "name": "Compact > Posts",
      "description": {
        "content": "What is Free Post? \n\nFree Post is basically a type of `post`, with `post_type = 22` \n\n* free post requires `postable_type` and `postable_id`\n* current user must has visibility of `postable` to create a free_post for it. \n* free post does not take a `channel_id` as input\n* any API targeting on a single post can be used for `free_post`\n\nPlease use the regular post `create` API to create a free_post\n\n* Here we are applying `compact` serializer to the result. \n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
